name: Feature request
description: "Suggest something new for {{PROJECT_NAME}}."
labels: ["enhancement"]
body:
  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: |
        Check the [roadmap](https://github.com/{{REPOSITORY}}/blob/{{MAIN_BRANCH}}/docs/planning/ROADMAP.md) first: your idea may already be planned. To change how something existing works, use the "Improvement" form.
  - type: textarea
    id: problem
    attributes:
      label: The problem
      description: What you can't do today, or do by hand. Describe the situation, not only the solution.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: proposal
    attributes:
      label: Your proposal
      description: What {{PROJECT_NAME}} could do about it.
    validations:
      required: true
  - type: textarea
    id: alternatives
    attributes:
      label: Alternatives
      description: Other tools or workarounds you have tried, and what they lack.
  - type: checkboxes
    id: checks
    attributes:
      label: Before you submit
      options:
        - label: I searched the existing issues and the roadmap, and this isn't suggested yet.
          required: true
